r fully-fledged VR level editor!\nCreate amazing levels, Enjoy community-created content, and interact with other players!", "short_description": "Hyperstacks is a frenetic Action-Puzzle-Platformer-Sandbox combined with a very powerful level editor that offers Unlimited Gameplay in VR. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hyperstacks.flycricket.io/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Squirrel Bytes", "support_website_url": "https://squirrel-bytes.com/", "website_url": "https://hyperstacksgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "PUZZLE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "2101888623300440"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1086312283946187"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1084414990961799"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1044779884554669"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4464869350501708"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "729255027766411"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2768566860120234"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4464869350501708"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1086312283946187"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "37304068649238725", "version": "1.0.3"}, "id": "162453678797607", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5022888091116866", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "37304068649238725"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "162453678797607"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.2 - v1.0.3\n\nFixed a softlock in the grappling level where falling after grabbing a moving Grappling Block could prevent the NPC dialogue from finishing and leave an important Jumper disabled.\n\nFixed lasers and other line-based item previews scaling incorrectly depending on the map zoom level.\n\nFixed character subtitles displaying in English across most languages. Dialogue is now correctly localized in every supported language.\n\nAdded localized names to items in the Level Editor, making them easier to identify and understand.\n\nFixed 3D item previews rendering parts of their models in the wrong order. They now look cleaner and render more efficiently.\n\nLevel photos now appear immediately in the level preview and Load button after taking them with the Level Camera.\n\nSynchronized the save and load menus between both hands, preventing outdated names or selections from causing the wrong level to be saved, loaded, or overwritten.\n\nImproved the game version label with a V, a new text colour, better centring, and a slight move to the left because it just did not feel right.\n\nAdded dynamic music blending to the login room. Turn around toward the credits to hear the credits theme, then look back to smoothly return to the login music. There are actual people behind this game, and now they even have their own music.", "created_date": 1785601177, "id": "37304068649238725", "version": "1.0.3", "version_code": 203, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5022888091116866", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "37304068649238725"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "162453678797607"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed character phrases localization \n \nFixed some level editor items in the item selector to have line render scaling problems \n\nAdded music to the credits, just turn arround on the login screen, you just need to look back \n\nFixed a bug in the Grappling hooks level that makes the final jumpad to not activate, making the level impossible", "created_date": 1785539378, "id": "37288678647444392", "version": "1.0.2", "version_code": 202, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5022888091116866", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "37304068649238725"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "162453678797607"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1785422969, "id": "37256573513988239", "version": "1.0.1", "version_code": 201, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__ty